00:18:20,805 --> 00:18:22,999
he's roughly where he started,

578
00:18:22,999 --> 00:18:23,950
and stressed.

579
00:18:24,300 --> 00:18:25,382
At forty three,

580
00:18:25,382 --> 00:18:26,320
Chris resets.

581
00:18:26,500 --> 00:18:28,565
