591
00:18:45,072 --> 00:18:47,108
What do Elena and Chris have in

592
00:18:47,108 --> 00:18:47,568
common?

593
00:18:47,748 --> 00:18:48,909
Both felt behind,

594
00:18:48,909 --> 00:18:51,298
