00:18:54,725 --> 00:18:56,571
Elena turned it into a system.

599
00:18:56,751 --> 00:18:58,110
Chris turned it into a bet.

600
00:18:58,290 --> 00:18:59,478
In your thirties,

601
00:18:59,478 --> 00:19:01,435
a system almost always wins,

602
00:19:01,435 --> 00:19:04,162
because it keeps working long after the

603
00:19:04,162 --> 00:19:05,000
panic fades.

