a dependent care flexible spending account through

623
00:19:47,110 --> 00:19:49,712
your employer, or the Child and Dependent

624
00:19:49,712 --> 00:19:51,869
Care Credit may reduce your costs.

625
00:19:52,049 --> 00:19:54,305
Check the IRS website or ask a

626
00:19:54,305 --> 00:19:56,937
