654
00:20:56,673 --> 00:20:58,079
low cost index funds,

655
00:20:58,079 --> 00:21:00,558
Roth accounts and high yield savings,

656
00:21:00,558 --> 00:21:01,965
are better than ever.

657
00:21:02,145 --> 00:21:03,945
You can use them to build your

658
00:21:03,945 --> 00:21:06,104
own pension, one paycheck at a time.

659
00:21:06,454 --> 00:21:08,572
Let's make this real with a sample

660
00:21:08,572 --> 00:21:09,008
budget.

661
