739
00:23:50,243 --> 00:23:52,231
with an emergency fund and no high

740
00:23:52,231 --> 00:23:54,746
interest debt, you're in a strong position.

741
00:23:54,926 --> 00:23:56,888
Your job now is to protect it.

742
00:23:57,068 --> 00:23:58,983
Avoid big lifestyle jumps,

743
00:23:58,983 --> 00:24:00,015
