746
00:24:03,385 --> 00:24:06,281
Consider raising your savings rate toward twenty

747
00:24:06,281 --> 00:24:07,669
or twenty five percent,

748
00:24:07,669 --> 00:24:09,901
which could open the door to retiring

749
00:24:09,901 --> 00:24:12,074
earlier or working by choice in your

750
00:24:12,074 --> 00:24:12,556
fifties.

751
00:24:12,736 --> 00:24:14,245
And look at your taxes:

752
00:24:14,245 --> 00:24:17,001
making the most of tax advantaged accounts

753
00:24:17,001 --> 00:24:19,493
can add up significantly over decades.

754
00:24:19,844 --> 00:24:21,545
What you do in your thirties shapes

755
00:24:21,545 --> 00:24:22,177
your forties.

756
00:24:22,357 --> 00:24:24,459
People who build an emergency fund,

757
00:24:24,459 --> 00:24:26,920
clear high interest debt and save fifteen

758
00:24:26,920 --> 00:24:29,442
percent in their thirties often find their

759
00:24:29,442 --> 00:24:31,123
