00:27:12,487 --> 00:27:15,796
Day six: check your beneficiaries and insurance.

843
00:27:15,976 --> 00:27:18,378
Day seven: sit down with your partner,

844
00:27:18,378 --> 00:27:20,844
or yourself, and write your three money

845
00:27:20,844 --> 00:27:22,361
goals for the next year.

